### Error: Empty batch request
POST {{baseUrl}}/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": []
}

### Get non-existent key
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### Delete non-existent key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
